{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40862","headline":"锦带佩吴钩 · 张友正","name":"锦带佩吴钩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"带劒谁家子，春朝紫陌游。\n结边霞聚锦，悬处月随钩。\n彩缕回文出，雄芒练影浮。\n叶依花里艳，霜向锷中秋。\n的皪宜骢马，斓斒映绮裘。\n应须待报国，一刎月支头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张友正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}